t to know  that emma is none other than murdoch's  wife when the two meet dr schrieber  mentions that murdoch's memory has been  totally wiped out and some bad people  are on the hunt for him hence he asks  her to contact him immediately if she  meets murdock although confused emma  agrees in the next scene local police  along with inspector bumstead arrive at  the crime scene in the hotel and start  investigating turns out that it has been  the sixth murder case in the last month  and all of them have the same spiral  symbol drawn on them since murdoch has  been staying there inspector bumstead  immediately suspects him of the crime he  then calls emma to the police station  and warns her to turn her husband in as  he is a wanted criminal meanwhile  murdoch is wandering around the city  confused and scared as he reaches a  place he becomes uneasy and notices that  his fingerprints are glowing after a  while he finds himself in front of a  shell beach advertisement board the same  one from the greeting card he found in  the hotel suitcase curious he climbs up  the advertisement board but suddenly he  is confronted by the three tall men from  earlier who call themselves the  strangers one of them tries to use his  powers on murdoch to make him sleep but  it fails this shocks the strangers but  before they can comprehend anything  murdock uses his telekinetic powers and  subdues the three later we are taken to  the hideout of the strangers which turns  out to be a large underground compound  everyone is in shock that murdoch  possesses telekinetic powers like they  do here we get to know that murdoch was  part of an experiment called imprinting  but he somehow escaped by using his  powers now he has become a wanted man  for the strangers on the other hand emma  returns home from the police station and  finds murdoch waiting for her although  he doesn't seem to remember her he knows  that he lives there as the address was  mentioned in his business card emma  tries to 